              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بازجویی (bâzjuyi) — \"an interrogation, questioning\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بازجویی (bâzjuyi) مظنون سه ساعت طول کشید. Bâzjuyi-ye maznun se sâ'at tul keshid. The questioning of the suspect took three hours."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bâz \"again\" + ju \"seeking\", from jostan \"to seek\". Bâzjuyi kardan is \"to interrogate\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bâzjuyi joins bâz \"again\" and ju-, the present stem of jostan \"to seek\", with the noun suffix -i. All of it is native Persian; EtymDB lists no entry."
            }
          ]
        },
